OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather for Lewes Bonfire
OL,4,Acelebrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewes's bonfire societies have filled
OL,7,Fthe town centre for its annual parade,
OL,8,Fincluding effigies of Fifa boss Gianni
OL,9,FInfantino and Prime Minister Andy
OL,10,FBurnham.
OL,12,FBonfire societies from Lewes all
OL,13,Forganise their own bonfires, effigies
OL,14,Fand fireworks displays as part of the
OL,15,Fannual parade held each year on 5
OL,16,FNovember.
OL,18,FOther effigies in the procession, which
OL,19,Fattracts tens of thousands of people a
OL,20,Fyear, took aim at water companies
OL,21,Fincluding Southern Water.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
