OL,3,GNEWSACrowds gather for Lewes Bonfire
OL,4,Acelebrations
OL,5,
OL,6,FMick Symes, chair of Lewes Borough
OL,7,FBonfire Society, told BBC Radio Sussex:
OL,8,F"Ours is topical and should strike a
OL,9,Fnote with local people, but its a well
OL,10,Fkept secret."
